  "instructions": [
    "In a large pot, heat 2 tablespoons of oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the curry powder and turmeric and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the red lentils, chopped nuka-pickle, white wine vinegar, salt, and water to the pot.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 30 minutes.",
    "Stir the curry occasionally as it simmers.",
    "After 30 minutes, remove the pot from the heat and let it cool slightly.",
    "Serve the curry hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
